    "title": "Token Transit",
    "description": "Use Token Transit to buy passes and ride public transit using your phone. Easy, quick, and convenient: buy your passes and ride anytime. \r\n\r\n1. Purchase - Select your preferred fare type in the Token Transit app.\r\n2. Activate - When you are ready to ride, tap your ticket to activate. Your phone holds all your tickets.\r\n3. Ride - As you board the vehicle, show the driver your digital ticket.\r\n\r\nDownload and start riding today! \r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\nLive in over 150 cities across the US and Canada.\r\n\r\nSee full list of available transit agencies here: https://tokentransit.com/agency",
